# NFM-3328: build context hygiene. Without this, host-side node_modules
# (macOS/pnpm symlinks pointing at darwin binaries) get COPY'd into the
# image and shadow the container's own install — turbopack then resolves
# @tailwindcss/postcss / lightningcss to the WRONG platform binaries and
# the build fails with "Cannot find module". This has been latent debt
# since the repo root never had a .dockerignore; it started biting on
# 2026-08-18 when dependabot PR #869 bumped tailwindcss 4.3.2 -> 4.3.3
# and every clean (--no-cache) prod web build since then failed.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.DS_Store

# pnpm / corepack caches never belong in a build
**/.pnpm-store
**/.corepack-cache

# Local dev artifacts
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.log
**/coverage
docs/
*.md
!README.md
# Agent/workspace artifacts (35G+ — would stall the build context transfer)
.paperclip
.worktrees
.venv
.gitnexus
.git
# NFM-4333: legacy builder (DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0) runs `docker build` as the
# nfmdeploy identity via the G2 gate; host-side dot-directories with
# 0600 user files (e.g. .claude/skills/**/SKILL.md, mode 600 owned by
# lwj04) make the build-context scan fail with "no permission to read".
.claude
.mimosa
.tmp

# NFM-4333 supplement (RC11 follow-up census, 2026-09-06): same failure
# class — every remaining non-world-readable path outside apps/packages
# (host-side chmod a+r covers tracked source; agent dirs are ignored
# here instead of chmod'd). Root .env* backups stay 600 AND must never
# enter an image (secret hygiene); they are not matched by **/.env above.
memory
.serena
.hermes
.zcode
.video_agent
gui-test-screenshots
.env*

# NFM-4333 RC7: deploy identity is nfmdeploy (ADR-013 G2); it cannot read
# lwj04-owned 0600 agent-session artifacts, and secrets must never enter a
# build context at all. These paths are untracked local state on the host
# canonical copy (~/Projects/nucpot); git never ships them.
.env*
docker/.env*
**/.claude
**/.mimosa
**/.zcode
.tmp
.video_agent
gui-test-screenshots
wt-sre-branch-protection-spec-v2
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
